      "sourceTextSha256": "e50e441bf4bf9318b9ab84bc27fbe38697063ceaf9a1f564a05a6632378cf7b5",
      "text": "We invite you to experience the famous Carnival in Rio de Janeiro, one of the most grandiose and vibrant cultural events on the planet! See the widest waterfalls in the world, Iguazu Falls, the exquisite architecture of Buenos Aires, natural wonders like the Uyuni Salt Flats and the floating Uros Islands on Lake Titicaca. And finally, visit the renowned and mysterious Machu Picchu. The best of Latin America – all in one tour!",
